      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A very off-kilter adventure game about university life with light shooting and platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial scenario is as follows, you play as <strong>Para</strong>, an up and coming freshman at the <strong>Tiffson Institute</strong>, all seems to be going well as the semester begins until you get an odd task from a mysterious creature. Asking you to take all of your dorm-mates out for a meal, and failing this &quot;test&quot; will lead to your demise. With no other choices in tow you push forward to pass this test... Little does Para know, things continue to spiral from here. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Controls (Defaults):</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q &amp; E</strong> : Swaps outfits </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G</strong> : For special actions (i.e. showing fortunes) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click (Right Mouse Button)</strong> : Enters First Person Mode </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click (Left Mouse Button)</strong> : Interacts with objects ( Third Person Mode Only ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left Click (Left Mouse)</strong> : Fires your weapon ( First Person Mode Only ) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacebar</strong> : Jumps, or Advances a text box </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter / Return</strong> : Skips dialog events</p>",
